[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install BepInEx 5.[/*]
[*]Create the folder:
[code]BepInEx/plugins/GK2KnownFormulaHelper[/code]
[/*]
[*]Copy [b]GK2KnownFormulaHelper.dll[/b] into that folder.[/*]
[*]Start or restart the game.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Updating[/b][/size]

Close the game, extract the new Nexus ZIP into the game folder and replace the previous helper DLL.

If an older installation uses another plugin folder or the filename [b]GK2LaboratoryFolioHelper.dll[/b], remove that old helper copy so only one version is loaded. Keep your existing configuration file.

The position preview is disabled by default. If you enabled it for testing, set [b]Enabled = false[/b] in the [b]Debug.HudPositionPreview[/b] section of the configuration file for normal play.
